# ==============================================================================
# Environment Configuration for Nagendra Kushwaha's AI Portfolio + Mr. Kennedy AI Digital Twin
# ==============================================================================
# Security Notice:
# All external AI API keys (OPENAI_API_KEY, ELEVENLABS_API_KEY, ADMIN_API_KEY) are
