# ==============================================================================
# 1. Local Open-Weight Ollama AI Engine (Primary / Zero Paid Cost)
# ==============================================================================
# Runs locally on your laptop (e.g. AMD Ryzen 5 5500U, 16 GB RAM) with zero API bills.
# Model: Qwen2.5 1.5B Instruct (940 MB Q4_K_M quant, ~24 tokens/sec on CPU)
# No API keys required. 100% private.
